// [title, cat, emoji, minutes, difficulty(1 very easy,2 easy,3 medium), cozy, serves, description, ingredients(;), steps(|), flags]
const RAW=[
// ================= PART 1 =================
["Lasagna Soup","soup","🍲",45,2,10,4,"All the cheesy, saucy joy of lasagna with none of the layering, finished with a dollop of ricotta.","1 lb|italian sausage;1|onion|diced;4 clove|garlic|minced;2 tbsp|tomato paste;1 can|crushed tomatoes|28 oz;4 cup|chicken broth;1 tsp|italian seasoning;8|lasagna noodles|broken;1/2 cup|ricotta;1 cup|mozzarella;1/2 cup|parmesan;|basil|to top;|salt|to taste","Brown the sausage in a big pot, add onion for 5 minutes, then garlic and tomato paste for 1 minute.|Add crushed tomatoes, broth and Italian seasoning and bring to a boil.|Add the broken noodles and simmer 10 to 12 minutes, stirring often, until tender. Season.|Mix ricotta, mozzarella and half the parmesan. Top each bowl with a big spoonful, more parmesan and basil.","hot"],
["Creamy Chicken Broccoli Cheddar Soup","soup","🥦",40,2,10,4,"Panera-style broccoli cheddar with tender chicken so it counts as dinner. Bread bowl encouraged.","1 lb|chicken breast|small bites;4 tbsp|butter;1|onion|diced;2|carrots|grated;2 clove|garlic;1/4 cup|flour;3 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|milk;1 cup|heavy cream;1 head|broccoli|chopped small;2 cup|cheddar|shredded;|salt|to taste;|black pepper|to taste","Brown the seasoned chicken in 1 tbsp butter and set aside.|Melt the rest of the butter, cook onion and carrot 5 minutes, add garlic, then stir in flour for 1 minute.|Whisk in broth, milk and cream. Add broccoli and chicken and simmer 12 minutes.|On low heat, stir in the cheddar a handful at a time until melted."],
["Loaded Baked Potato Soup","soup","🥔",40,2,10,4,"Thick, creamy potato soup with every baked-potato topping piled on top.","6 slice|bacon;2 lb|potatoes|diced;1|onion|diced;3 tbsp|butter;1/4 cup|flour;4 cup|chicken broth;1 1/2 cup|milk;1 1/2 cup|cheddar;1/2 cup|sour cream;3|green onion;|salt|to taste","Cook bacon crisp, crumble it, and leave 1 tbsp fat in the pot.|Add butter and onion for 4 minutes, stir in flour, then whisk in broth and milk.|Add potatoes and simmer 15 to 18 minutes until very tender. Mash about half right in the pot.|Stir in sour cream and most of the cheese. Top with bacon, cheese and green onion."],
["Creamy Sausage Tortellini Soup","soup","🍲",45,2,9.5,4,"Italian sausage, cheese tortellini and spinach in a creamy tomato broth.","1 lb|italian sausage;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;1 can|diced tomatoes;4 cup|chicken broth;1 tsp|italian seasoning;9 oz|tortellini;1 cup|heavy cream;2 cup|spinach;1/2 cup|parmesan","Brown sausage, add onion until soft, then garlic.|Add tomatoes, broth and seasoning and simmer 10 minutes.|Add tortellini and cook 5 to 7 minutes.|Lower the heat, stir in cream and spinach until wilted, and finish with parmesan."],
["Roasted Tomato Basil Soup & Grilled Cheese","soup","🍅",60,2,10,4,"Oven-roasted tomatoes blended silky smooth, with golden grilled cheese for dunking.","3 lb|tomatoes|halved;1|onion|quartered;6 clove|garlic;3 tbsp|olive oil;2 cup|chicken broth;1/2 cup|heavy cream;1 cup|basil;8 slice|bread;8 slice|cheddar;3 tbsp|butter;|salt|to taste","Roast tomatoes, onion and garlic with olive oil, salt and pepper at 425°F for 35 to 40 minutes.|Simmer with broth 10 minutes, add basil, blend smooth and stir in cream.|Butter the bread, add 2 slices cheddar per sandwich and cook low and slow until golden on both sides.|Cut into strips and dunk. Mandatory."],
["Creamy Beef Stroganoff","comfort","🥩",30,2,9.5,4,"Tender beef and mushrooms in a rich sour cream sauce over buttery egg noodles.","1 1/2 lb|sirloin steak|thin strips;3 tbsp|butter;8 oz|mushrooms;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|flour;2 cup|beef broth;1 tbsp|worcestershire;1 tsp|dijon mustard;3/4 cup|sour cream;12 oz|egg noodles;|parsley","Cook the noodles. Sear the seasoned beef in batches in hot butter, 1 minute per side, and set aside.|Cook mushrooms and onion until golden, add garlic, then sprinkle in flour.|Whisk in broth, worcestershire and dijon and simmer until thick.|Off the heat stir in sour cream and the beef. Serve over noodles with parsley."],
["Butter Chicken & Rice","comfort","🍛",45,3,9,4,"Silky, mildly spiced tomato cream sauce with tender chicken. Better than takeout, eaten in pajamas.","1 1/2 lb|chicken thighs|bites;1/2 cup|greek yogurt;2 tbsp|garam masala;1 tsp|cumin;4 tbsp|butter;1|onion;4 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;2 tbsp|tomato paste;1 can|crushed tomatoes|15 oz;3/4 cup|heavy cream;1 1/2 cup|rice;|cilantro;|salt|to taste","Marinate chicken in yogurt, half the garam masala, cumin and salt for at least 15 minutes. Start the rice.|Brown chicken in 1 tbsp butter and set aside.|Cook onion in the rest of the butter, then garlic, ginger, tomato paste and remaining garam masala for 1 minute.|Add tomatoes and simmer 10 minutes, stir in cream and chicken for 5 more. Serve over rice with cilantro."],
["Creamy Chicken Pesto Pasta","comfort","🍝",30,2,9,4,"Basil pesto plus cream equals the dreamiest green sauce, with juicy chicken and burst tomatoes.","1 lb|penne;1 lb|chicken breast|bites;1 tbsp|olive oil;2 clove|garlic;1 cup|cherry tomatoes;1/2 cup|pesto;3/4 cup|heavy cream;1/2 cup|parmesan;|salt|to taste","Cook pasta and save 1/2 cup pasta water.|Cook seasoned chicken in olive oil until golden, then add garlic and tomatoes for 2 minutes.|Lower the heat and stir in pesto, cream and parmesan.|Toss with pasta, loosening with pasta water."],
["Creamy Chicken & Gnocchi","comfort","🥟",40,2,9.5,4,"Pillowy gnocchi in a creamy parmesan sauce with chicken and spinach. One pan.","1 lb|chicken breast|bites;1 lb|gnocchi;2 tbsp|butter;1/2|onion;3 clove|garlic;1 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|heavy cream;1/2 cup|parmesan;1/3 cup|sun-dried tomatoes;2 cup|spinach;1 tsp|italian seasoning","Brown the gnocchi in 1 tbsp butter until golden and set aside.|Cook the seasoned chicken in the rest of the butter, then onion and garlic for 2 minutes.|Add broth, cream, parmesan and sun-dried tomatoes and simmer 3 minutes.|Fold in spinach and gnocchi until coated."],
["Honey-Sriracha Salmon Bowls","light","🐟",30,2,7.5,4,"Sweet-spicy glazed salmon over rice with avocado and crunchy cucumber.","4 fillet|salmon;3 tbsp|honey;2 tbsp|sriracha;2 tbsp|soy sauce;1 1/2 cup|rice;1|cucumber;1|avocado;2|green onion;1 tbsp|sesame seeds;2 tbsp|mayonnaise","Cook rice. Whisk honey, most of the sriracha and soy sauce and brush over salmon.|Bake at 400°F for 12 to 14 minutes (air fryer 390°F, 8 to 10), glazing again halfway.|Stir the rest of the sriracha into mayo.|Build bowls with rice, salmon, cucumber, avocado, green onion, sesame and spicy mayo.","hot"],
["Blackened Shrimp Tacos","light","🌮",30,2,7,4,"Smoky cajun shrimp with crunchy slaw and cool lime crema. Tastes like vacation.","1 lb|shrimp;1 1/2 tbsp|cajun seasoning;1 tbsp|olive oil;8|corn tortillas;2 cup|coleslaw mix;1/2 cup|sour cream;2|lime;1|avocado;|cilantro","Toss shrimp with cajun seasoning and oil.|Mix sour cream with lime juice and salt. Toss slaw with a squeeze of lime.|Sear shrimp in a very hot pan 1 to 2 minutes per side.|Fill warm tortillas with slaw, shrimp, avocado, crema and cilantro."],
["Roasted Vegetable & Feta Pasta","light","🫑",45,2,8,4,"Caramelized roasted veggies and creamy baked feta tossed with pasta.","1|zucchini;1|bell pepper;1|onion;1 pint|cherry tomatoes;4 tbsp|olive oil;3 clove|garlic;1 tsp|italian seasoning;8 oz|feta|block;12 oz|penne;|basil","Toss chopped veggies and garlic with oil, seasoning, salt and pepper in a baking dish, feta block in the middle.|Roast at 425°F for 30 minutes.|Cook pasta, saving some water.|Smash the feta into the veggies, add pasta and a splash of water, and toss. Top with basil."],
["Crispy Chicken Caesar Wraps","lunch","🌯",30,2,7,4,"Golden panko chicken, crisp romaine and creamy caesar, all wrapped up.","1 lb|chicken breast|strips;1|eggs;1 cup|panko;1/2 cup|parmesan;4|flour tortillas;3 cup|lettuce;1/3 cup|caesar dressing;2 tbsp|olive oil","Dip chicken in beaten egg, then panko mixed with half the parmesan.|Pan fry 3 to 4 minutes per side or air fry at 400°F for 10 to 12 minutes.|Toss lettuce with dressing and remaining parmesan.|Wrap with sliced chicken and toast seam-side down for 1 minute."],
["Smash Burger Tacos","lunch","🌮",25,2,8.5,4,"The viral one. Beef smashed onto a tortilla with crispy edges, melty cheese and burger sauce.","1 lb|ground beef;8|flour tortillas|small;8 slice|american cheese;1/2|onion|finely diced;2 cup|lettuce;1/4 cup|pickles;1/3 cup|mayonnaise;1 tbsp|ketchup;1 tsp|mustard","Mix mayo, ketchup, mustard and chopped pickles for sauce.|Press a thin layer of beef onto each tortilla, season and sprinkle onion.|Cook beef-side down in a hot skillet 2 to 3 minutes, flip, add cheese for 1 minute.|Fold and stuff with lettuce, pickles and sauce.","hot"],
["Easy Chicken Pesto Pasta Lunch","lunch","🥗",20,1,8,2,"Quick pesto pasta that's just as good cold the next day.","8 oz|penne;1/2 lb|chicken breast|cooked;1/3 cup|pesto;1 cup|cherry tomatoes;1 cup|spinach;1/4 cup|parmesan","Cook and drain penne.|Toss hot pasta with pesto and spinach so it wilts.|Add sliced chicken and tomatoes and top with parmesan."],
["3-Ingredient Egg Roll Bowl","quick","🥢",15,1,7.5,3,"Everything good inside an egg roll, minus the wrapper. Fast, cheap and weirdly addictive.","1 lb|ground pork;14 oz|coleslaw mix;3 tbsp|soy sauce;2 clove|garlic|optional;1 tsp|sesame oil;2|green onion;|sriracha|to drizzle","Brown the pork, breaking it up, 6 to 7 minutes. Add garlic.|Add coleslaw mix and soy sauce and toss 3 to 4 minutes until just wilted.|Finish with sesame oil, green onion and sriracha.","hot"],
["Garlic Parmesan Butter Chicken","quick","🍗",25,1,8.5,4,"Golden chicken cutlets drowned in garlic butter and parmesan.","1 1/2 lb|chicken breast|cutlets;2 tbsp|flour;1 tsp|italian seasoning;4 tbsp|butter;5 clove|garlic;1/2 cup|parmesan;1/4 cup|chicken broth;|parsley","Season and lightly flour the cutlets.|Sear in 1 tbsp butter 4 to 5 minutes per side and set aside.|Melt remaining butter with garlic, add broth and parmesan to make a glossy sauce.|Return chicken, spoon sauce over and top with parsley."],
["Creamy Baked Feta Pasta","quick","🍅",50,1,8.5,4,"The pasta that broke the internet: a whole block of feta roasted with cherry tomatoes.","2 pint|cherry tomatoes;8 oz|feta|block;1/3 cup|olive oil;3 clove|garlic;1/2 tsp|red pepper flakes;12 oz|penne;1 cup|basil;|salt|to taste","Put tomatoes and garlic in a baking dish with oil, salt and pepper flakes, feta in the center.|Bake at 400°F for 35 to 40 minutes.|Cook pasta, saving some water.|Smash it all together with pasta, basil and a splash of pasta water.","hot"],
["Slow-Cooker Loaded Potato Soup","prep","🥔",360,1,10,6,"Toss it in, walk away, come back to the creamiest potato soup ever.","3 lb|potatoes|diced;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;5 cup|chicken broth;8 oz|cream cheese;1 1/2 cup|cheddar;6 slice|bacon|cooked;1/2 cup|sour cream;3|green onion","Add potatoes, onion, garlic, broth, salt and pepper to the slow cooker.|Cook low 6 to 7 hours or high 3 to 4 hours.|Mash half the potatoes and stir in cream cheese, cheddar and sour cream.|Top with bacon, cheese and green onion."],
["White Chicken Chili","prep","🥣",70,3,9.5,6,"Creamy, mildly spicy chili with white beans, green chiles and shredded chicken.","1 1/2 lb|chicken breast;1 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;4 clove|garlic;2 can|cannellini beans;1 can|green chiles;4 cup|chicken broth;2 tsp|cumin;1 tsp|oregano;4 oz|cream cheese;1 cup|frozen corn;1|lime;1 cup|monterey jack;|cilantro","Cook onion in oil 5 minutes, add garlic, cumin and oregano.|Add broth, chiles, beans and whole chicken and simmer covered 25 to 30 minutes.|Shred the chicken, mash some beans to thicken, then stir in cream cheese, corn and chicken for 10 minutes.|Finish with lime and top with cheese and cilantro."],
["Chicken Egg Roll Rice Bowls","prep","🍚",30,2,8,4,"Egg roll filling with chicken over rice with spicy mayo. Great lunches all week.","1 lb|chicken breast|diced;1 tbsp|vegetable oil;3 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;14 oz|coleslaw mix;3 tbsp|soy sauce;1 tsp|sesame oil;1 1/2 cup|rice;3 tbsp|mayonnaise;1 tbsp|sriracha;2|green onion","Cook the rice. Brown chicken in oil over high heat.|Add garlic and ginger, then slaw and soy sauce and toss 3 minutes.|Finish with sesame oil. Mix mayo and sriracha.|Portion into containers with rice, drizzle and green onion."],
// ================= PART 2 =================
["Lemon Chicken Orzo Soup","soup","🍋",35,2,9.5,6,"Bright, lemony and cozy, with tiny orzo in every spoonful.","1 lb|chicken breast;1 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;2|carrots;2 stalk|celery;3 clove|garlic;8 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|orzo;2|lemon;2 cup|spinach;|dried thyme|1 tsp;|parsley","Cook onion, carrot and celery in oil 6 minutes, then garlic and thyme.|Add broth and whole chicken and simmer 15 minutes. Shred the chicken.|Add orzo and cook 8 to 10 minutes.|Stir in chicken, spinach, lemon juice and parsley."],
["Homemade French Onion Soup","soup","🧅",90,3,10,4,"Deeply caramelized onions, rich broth and a bubbly gruyere crouton lid.","3 lb|onion|thinly sliced;4 tbsp|butter;1 tsp|sugar;2 tbsp|flour;6 cup|beef broth;1 tbsp|worcestershire;1 tsp|dried thyme;1|french bread;2 cup|gruyere","Cook onions in butter over medium-low with sugar and salt for 45 to 60 minutes, stirring, until deep golden.|Stir in flour, then broth, worcestershire and thyme. Simmer 20 minutes.|Toast thick slices of bread.|Ladle into oven-safe bowls, top with bread and gruyere and broil until bubbly."],
["Creamy Cajun Chicken Noodle Soup","soup","🌶️",40,2,9.5,6,"Classic chicken noodle with a creamy cajun kick.","1 lb|chicken breast;2 tbsp|butter;1|onion;2|carrots;2 stalk|celery;3 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|cajun seasoning;2 tbsp|flour;6 cup|chicken broth;8 oz|egg noodles;1 cup|heavy cream;|parsley","Cook veggies in butter 6 minutes, add garlic, cajun and flour.|Whisk in broth, add chicken and simmer 15 minutes, then shred.|Add noodles and cook 7 minutes.|Stir in cream and chicken and top with parsley."],
["Stuffed Bell Pepper Soup","soup","🫑",40,2,9,6,"All the flavor of stuffed peppers in an easy, hearty soup.","1 lb|ground beef;1|onion;3|bell pepper|diced;3 clove|garlic;1 can|diced tomatoes;1 can|tomato sauce;4 cup|beef broth;1 tsp|italian seasoning;3/4 cup|rice;1 cup|cheddar","Brown beef with onion and peppers, then add garlic.|Add tomatoes, sauce, broth and seasoning and simmer 10 minutes.|Add rice and simmer 15 to 18 minutes until tender.|Top bowls with cheddar."],
["Sausage, Lentil & Kale Soup","soup","🥬",55,2,9,6,"Hearty, earthy and good for you, with plenty of sausage for comfort.","1 lb|italian sausage;1|onion;2|carrots;2 stalk|celery;3 clove|garlic;1 1/2 cup|lentils;1 can|diced tomatoes;8 cup|chicken broth;3 cup|kale;1 tbsp|apple cider vinegar;|parmesan","Brown sausage, then add onion, carrot and celery for 6 minutes and garlic.|Add lentils, tomatoes and broth and simmer 30 to 35 minutes.|Stir in kale until wilted and add the vinegar.|Serve with parmesan."],
["Homemade Chicken Pot Pie","comfort","🥧",55,3,10,6,"Flaky golden crust over creamy chicken and veggies. Peak cozy.","1 lb|chicken breast|cooked, diced;4 tbsp|butter;1|onion;2|carrots;2 stalk|celery;1/3 cup|flour;1 1/2 cup|chicken broth;3/4 cup|milk;1 cup|frozen peas;1 tsp|dried thyme;2|pie crust;1|eggs","Cook onion, carrot and celery in butter 6 minutes, stir in flour, then whisk in broth and milk until thick.|Add chicken, peas, thyme, salt and pepper.|Fill the bottom crust, cover, crimp, vent and brush with egg.|Bake at 400°F for 30 to 35 minutes and rest 10."],
["Easy Skillet Shepherd's Pie","comfort","🥧",50,2,10,6,"Savory beef and veggies under a fluffy, cheesy mashed potato blanket.","1 1/2 lb|ground beef;1|onion;2|carrots;2 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|tomato paste;1 tbsp|worcestershire;1 tbsp|flour;1 cup|beef broth;1 cup|frozen peas;2 lb|potatoes;4 tbsp|butter;1/2 cup|milk;1/2 cup|cheddar","Boil and mash potatoes with butter, milk, salt and pepper.|Brown beef with onion and carrot, then garlic, tomato paste, flour and worcestershire.|Add broth and peas and simmer until thick.|Top with mash and cheddar and broil 5 minutes."],
["Four-Cheese Baked Mac & Cheese","comfort","🧀",55,3,10,8,"Crispy golden top, outrageously creamy middle. A holiday-level side that's really a main.","1 lb|elbow macaroni;4 tbsp|butter;1/4 cup|flour;3 cup|milk;1 cup|heavy cream;2 cup|cheddar;1 cup|gruyere;1 cup|mozzarella;1/2 cup|parmesan;1 tsp|paprika;1/2 cup|panko","Boil pasta 2 minutes short of done.|Make a roux with butter and flour, whisk in milk and cream and simmer until thick.|Off the heat stir in most of the cheeses and paprika, then the pasta.|Pour into a dish, top with remaining cheese and panko and bake at 375°F for 25 minutes."],
["Slow-Cooker Beef Stew","comfort","🍲",480,1,10,6,"Fall-apart beef, potatoes and carrots in rich gravy. Set it in the morning.","2 lb|beef stew meat;1/4 cup|flour;1|onion;4|carrots;1 1/2 lb|potatoes;3 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|tomato paste;3 cup|beef broth;1 tbsp|worcestershire;1 tsp|dried thyme;1 cup|frozen peas","Toss beef in seasoned flour and brown it in a hot pan (optional but worth it).|Add everything except peas to the slow cooker.|Cook low 8 hours or high 5 hours.|Stir in peas for the last 10 minutes."],
["Cheesy Beef Baked Ziti","comfort","🧀",50,2,9.5,6,"Meaty marinara, creamy ricotta pockets and a bubbly mozzarella top.","1 lb|penne;1 lb|ground beef;2 clove|garlic;1 jar|marinara sauce;15 oz|ricotta;1|eggs;2 cup|mozzarella;1/2 cup|parmesan;1 tsp|italian seasoning","Boil pasta 2 minutes short. Brown beef with garlic and seasoning and stir in marinara.|Mix ricotta, egg and half the parmesan.|Layer pasta, sauce and ricotta dollops, then top with mozzarella and parmesan.|Bake at 375°F covered 20 minutes, then uncovered 10."],
["Creamy Sour-Cream Chicken Enchiladas","comfort","🌯",45,2,9,4,"Soft tortillas rolled around chicken and cheese, smothered in creamy sauce.","2 cup|chicken breast|cooked, shredded;8|flour tortillas;2 cup|monterey jack;3 tbsp|butter;3 tbsp|flour;2 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|sour cream;1 can|green chiles;|cilantro","Fill tortillas with chicken and some cheese, roll and place seam-down in a baking dish.|Make a roux with butter and flour, whisk in broth and simmer until thick.|Off the heat stir in sour cream and chiles and pour over.|Top with cheese and bake at 350°F for 20 to 25 minutes."],
["Philly Cheesesteak Orzo Skillet","comfort","🥩",40,2,9,4,"Cheesesteak flavors in a creamy one-pan orzo.","1 lb|sirloin steak|thin strips;1|onion;1|bell pepper;8 oz|mushrooms;2 tbsp|butter;1 1/2 cup|orzo;3 cup|beef broth;1 tbsp|worcestershire;6 slice|provolone","Sear steak in a hot skillet and set aside.|Cook onion, pepper and mushrooms in butter until soft.|Add orzo, broth and worcestershire and simmer covered 12 minutes.|Stir in steak, top with provolone and cover until melted."],
["Sticky Honey Garlic Chicken Bowls","quick","🍯",30,2,8.5,4,"Crispy chicken in a sticky, glossy honey garlic glaze over rice.","2 lb|chicken thighs;1 tsp|garlic powder;2 tbsp|butter;5 clove|garlic;1/3 cup|honey;1/4 cup|soy sauce;1 tbsp|rice vinegar;1 1/2 cup|rice;1 head|broccoli;2|green onion","Cook rice and steam broccoli. Season chicken with garlic powder, salt and pepper.|Sear chicken 6 minutes per side and pour off extra fat.|Add butter and garlic, then honey, soy and vinegar and simmer until sticky.|Serve over rice with broccoli and green onion."],
["Easy Buffalo Chicken Wraps","quick","🌯",15,1,8,4,"Spicy buffalo chicken, cool ranch and crunchy lettuce. Lunch in 15.","1 lb|chicken breast|cooked, shredded;1/3 cup|buffalo sauce;4|flour tortillas;2 cup|lettuce;1/4 cup|ranch dressing;1 cup|cheddar;1|carrots|shredded","Toss chicken with buffalo sauce.|Layer lettuce, carrot, chicken, cheddar and ranch on tortillas.|Roll and toast seam-side down until golden."],
["Cheesy Chicken Quesadillas","quick","🧀",15,1,8.5,2,"Crispy, gooey, golden. The 15-minute dinner that never disappoints.","4|flour tortillas;2 cup|mexican cheese blend;1/2 lb|chicken breast|cooked;1 tbsp|butter;2|green onion;|salsa;|sour cream","Fill half of each tortilla with cheese, chicken and green onion, and fold.|Cook in butter over medium 2 to 3 minutes per side.|Cut into wedges and serve with salsa and sour cream."],
["Takeout-Style Beef & Broccoli","quick","🥦",30,2,8.5,4,"Tender beef and bright broccoli in a glossy savory sauce. Cancel the delivery.","1 lb|flank steak|thin slices;2 tbsp|cornstarch;1/3 cup|soy sauce;3 tbsp|brown sugar;2 tbsp|oyster sauce;3 clove|garlic;1 tsp|ginger;1 tsp|sesame oil;1 head|broccoli;2 tbsp|vegetable oil;1 1/2 cup|rice","Cook rice. Toss beef with 1 tbsp cornstarch.|Whisk soy, sugar, oyster sauce, garlic, ginger, sesame oil, remaining cornstarch and 1/2 cup water.|Steam broccoli in the pan 3 minutes and remove. Sear beef in hot oil in batches.|Add sauce until glossy, toss in broccoli and serve over rice."],
["Sausage, Peppers & Rice Skillet","quick","🫑",40,2,9,4,"Smoky sausage, sweet peppers and tomatoey rice in one skillet.","14 oz|smoked sausage|sliced;2|bell pepper;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;1 cup|rice;1 can|diced tomatoes;2 cup|chicken broth;1 tsp|paprika;1 tsp|italian seasoning","Brown the sausage and set aside.|Cook peppers and onion 5 minutes, add garlic, rice and spices.|Add tomatoes and broth, cover and simmer 18 to 20 minutes.|Stir in sausage and let it sit 5 minutes."],
["Chicken Fajita Pasta Bake","quick","🌶️",60,1,8.5,6,"Fajita-spiced chicken and peppers in a cheesy creamy pasta bake.","1 lb|penne;1 1/2 lb|chicken breast|bites;2|bell pepper;1|onion;2 tbsp|taco seasoning;1 can|diced tomatoes;1 cup|heavy cream;2 cup|mexican cheese blend;1 tbsp|olive oil;|cilantro","Cook pasta 2 minutes short.|Cook chicken, peppers and onion with taco seasoning in oil.|Stir in tomatoes, cream, half the cheese and the pasta.|Top with cheese and bake at 375°F for 20 minutes."],
["Crispy Turkey Pesto Melt","lunch","🥪",20,2,8,2,"Turkey, pesto and melty mozzarella pressed until crispy.","4 slice|bread;6 oz|deli turkey;2 tbsp|pesto;1 cup|mozzarella;1|tomatoes|sliced;2 tbsp|butter","Spread pesto inside the bread.|Layer turkey, tomato and mozzarella.|Butter the outsides and cook pressed in a skillet 3 to 4 minutes per side."],
["The Ultimate Tuna Melt","lunch","🥪",20,1,8.5,2,"Crispy buttery bread, lemony tuna and a waterfall of melted cheddar.","2 can|tuna;1/3 cup|mayonnaise;1 stalk|celery;1 tsp|dijon mustard;1/2|lemon;4 slice|bread;4 slice|cheddar;2 tbsp|butter","Mix tuna, mayo, celery, dijon, lemon and pepper.|Layer cheese, tuna, cheese between buttered bread.|Cook covered over medium-low 3 to 4 minutes per side."],
["Coconut Red Curry Dumpling Soup","lunch","🥟",25,2,9,4,"Frozen dumplings simmered in a spicy coconut curry broth. Fast and so cozy.","1 tbsp|vegetable oil;3 tbsp|red curry paste;3 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;1 can|coconut milk;4 cup|chicken broth;1 tbsp|soy sauce;20|frozen dumplings;2 cup|spinach;1|lime;2|green onion","Fry curry paste, garlic and ginger in oil 1 minute.|Add coconut milk, broth and soy sauce and bring to a simmer.|Add dumplings and cook per package, about 6 minutes.|Stir in spinach and lime juice and top with green onion.","hot"],
["Quick Ginger Pork Noodles","lunch","🍜",20,2,8.5,2,"Savory gingery pork tossed with chewy noodles.","1/2 lb|ground pork;6 oz|ramen noodles;1 tbsp|ginger;2 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|soy sauce;1 tbsp|hoisin sauce;1 tsp|sesame oil;1 cup|spinach;2|green onion","Cook noodles and drain.|Brown pork, add ginger and garlic.|Add soy, hoisin, noodles and spinach and toss.|Finish with sesame oil and green onion."],
["Sweet & Savory Chicken Lettuce Cups","lunch","🥬",20,1,7,4,"Crunchy, saucy chicken in cool lettuce leaves. Light but satisfying.","1 lb|ground chicken;1 tbsp|vegetable oil;2 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;3 tbsp|hoisin sauce;2 tbsp|soy sauce;1 tsp|rice vinegar;1 can|water chestnuts;1 head|butter lettuce;2|green onion","Brown chicken in oil with garlic and ginger.|Add hoisin, soy, vinegar and chopped water chestnuts and cook 2 minutes.|Spoon into lettuce leaves and top with green onion."],
["Garlic Butter Steak & Potato Foil Packets","lunch","🥩",45,2,9,4,"Steak bites and baby potatoes steamed in garlic butter. Barely any cleanup.","1 1/2 lb|sirloin steak|cubes;1 lb|baby potatoes|quartered;4 tbsp|butter|melted;4 clove|garlic;1 tsp|italian seasoning;|parsley","Microwave potatoes 4 minutes to par-cook.|Toss steak, potatoes, butter, garlic, seasoning, salt and pepper.|Divide onto foil, seal packets and bake at 425°F (or grill) 20 to 25 minutes.|Top with parsley."],
// ================= PART 3 =================
["Classic Chicken Noodle Soup","soup","🍜",45,2,10,6,"The cure for everything: rich broth, tender chicken, lots of noodles.","1 lb|chicken breast;2 tbsp|butter;1|onion;3|carrots;3 stalk|celery;3 clove|garlic;8 cup|chicken broth;1 tsp|dried thyme;8 oz|egg noodles;1/2|lemon;|parsley","Cook onion, carrot and celery in butter 6 minutes, add garlic.|Add broth, thyme and chicken and simmer 20 minutes, then shred.|Add noodles and cook 6 to 8 minutes.|Finish with lemon, parsley, salt and pepper."],
["Creamy Mushroom Pasta","comfort","🍄",25,2,9,4,"Golden mushrooms and garlic in a silky parmesan cream sauce.","12 oz|fettuccine;1 lb|mushrooms;3 tbsp|butter;4 clove|garlic;1 tsp|dried thyme;1 cup|heavy cream;3/4 cup|parmesan;|parsley","Cook pasta, saving some water.|Brown mushrooms in butter without stirring too much, then add garlic and thyme.|Add cream and parmesan and simmer 2 minutes.|Toss with pasta and parsley."],
["Italian Wedding Soup","soup","🥣",45,3,9.5,6,"Tiny meatballs, greens and little pasta in a golden broth.","1 lb|ground beef;1/3 cup|breadcrumbs;1|eggs;1/3 cup|parmesan;2 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;2|carrots;8 cup|chicken broth;3/4 cup|orzo;3 cup|spinach","Mix beef, breadcrumbs, egg, parmesan and garlic and roll into tiny meatballs.|Cook onion and carrot in oil, then add broth and bring to a boil.|Add meatballs and orzo and simmer 10 minutes.|Stir in spinach and serve with parmesan."],
["Chicken & Wild Rice Soup","soup","🍚",55,2,9.5,6,"Creamy, nutty wild rice soup. Like a cabin in the woods in a bowl.","1 lb|chicken breast;4 tbsp|butter;1|onion;2|carrots;2 stalk|celery;8 oz|mushrooms;1/4 cup|flour;6 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|wild rice;1 cup|heavy cream;1 tsp|dried thyme","Cook veggies and mushrooms in butter, stir in flour.|Whisk in broth, add wild rice, thyme and chicken and simmer 40 minutes.|Shred chicken and stir back in with cream."],
["Roasted Butternut Squash Soup","soup","🎃",60,2,9.5,6,"Velvety, sweet and savory with a whisper of cinnamon.","3 lb|butternut squash|cubed;1|onion;2|carrots;3 tbsp|olive oil;3 clove|garlic;4 cup|chicken broth;1/2 cup|heavy cream;1/2 tsp|cinnamon;|salt|to taste","Roast squash, onion, carrot and garlic with oil at 425°F for 35 minutes.|Simmer with broth 10 minutes.|Blend smooth and stir in cream and cinnamon. Season."],
["Beef Barley Soup","soup","🍲",65,2,9.5,6,"Old-fashioned hearty soup with chewy barley and tender beef.","1 1/2 lb|beef stew meat;1 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;3|carrots;2 stalk|celery;3 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|tomato paste;8 cup|beef broth;3/4 cup|pearl barley;1 tsp|dried thyme","Brown beef in oil, then add veggies and garlic.|Stir in tomato paste, broth and thyme and simmer 30 minutes.|Add barley and simmer 25 to 30 minutes more until tender."],
["White Bean & Kale Soup","soup","🥬",35,2,9,6,"Simple, garlicky and nourishing with a parmesan finish.","2 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;2|carrots;4 clove|garlic;2 can|cannellini beans;1 can|diced tomatoes;6 cup|chicken broth;4 cup|kale;1 tsp|italian seasoning;|parmesan","Cook onion, carrot and garlic in oil 6 minutes.|Add beans, tomatoes, broth and seasoning and simmer 15 minutes.|Mash some beans for body, stir in kale until tender, and top with parmesan."],
["Sweet Potato Peanut Stew","soup","🍠",40,2,8.5,6,"West African-inspired stew, creamy with peanut butter and warm spices.","1 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;2 lb|sweet potatoes|cubed;1 can|diced tomatoes;4 cup|vegetable broth;1/2 cup|peanut butter;1 tsp|cumin;1 can|chickpeas;3 cup|spinach","Cook onion, garlic, ginger and cumin in oil.|Add sweet potatoes, tomatoes and broth and simmer 20 minutes.|Whisk in peanut butter and add chickpeas and spinach."],
["Miso Ramen with Jammy Eggs","soup","🍜",30,2,9,2,"Rich, savory miso broth, springy noodles and a perfect jammy egg.","2|eggs;1 tbsp|sesame oil;2 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;3 tbsp|miso paste;4 cup|chicken broth;1 tbsp|soy sauce;2 pack|ramen noodles;1 cup|mushrooms;1 cup|spinach;2|green onion","Boil eggs 6 1/2 minutes, chill in ice water and peel.|Sauté garlic and ginger in sesame oil, add broth and simmer, then whisk in miso and soy off the boil.|Cook noodles and mushrooms in the broth and add spinach.|Top with halved eggs and green onion.","hot"],
["Thai Coconut Chicken Soup","soup","🥥",35,2,9,4,"Tom kha-inspired: creamy coconut, lime and ginger with tender chicken.","1 lb|chicken breast|thin slices;1 tbsp|vegetable oil;1 tbsp|ginger;2 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|red curry paste;2 can|coconut milk;3 cup|chicken broth;8 oz|mushrooms;1 tbsp|fish sauce;2|lime;|cilantro","Fry ginger, garlic and curry paste in oil 1 minute.|Add coconut milk and broth and simmer.|Add chicken and mushrooms and cook 10 minutes.|Season with fish sauce and lime and top with cilantro."],
["Creamy Corn Chowder","soup","🌽",40,2,9.5,6,"Sweet corn, potatoes and bacon in a creamy, cozy chowder.","6 slice|bacon;1|onion;2 stalk|celery;2 tbsp|flour;4 cup|chicken broth;1 lb|potatoes|diced;4 cup|frozen corn;1 cup|heavy cream;|green onion","Cook bacon and crumble it, keeping some fat.|Cook onion and celery, stir in flour, then broth.|Add potatoes and corn and simmer 15 minutes.|Blend a third of it, stir in cream and top with bacon."],
["Tomato Tortellini Soup","soup","🍅",25,1,9,4,"Creamy tomato soup with cheesy tortellini. Done in 25 minutes.","1 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;1 can|crushed tomatoes;4 cup|chicken broth;1 tsp|italian seasoning;9 oz|tortellini;1/2 cup|heavy cream;2 cup|spinach;|parmesan","Cook onion and garlic in oil.|Add tomatoes, broth and seasoning and simmer 10 minutes.|Add tortellini for 5 to 7 minutes, then cream and spinach. Top with parmesan."],
["American Goulash","comfort","🍝",40,2,9.5,6,"Beefy tomato macaroni, the way grandma made it.","1 1/2 lb|ground beef;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;1 can|diced tomatoes;1 can|tomato sauce;3 cup|beef broth;1 tbsp|italian seasoning;1 tbsp|paprika;2 cup|elbow macaroni;1 cup|cheddar","Brown beef with onion and garlic.|Add tomatoes, sauce, broth and spices and simmer 15 minutes.|Add macaroni and cook covered 12 minutes until tender.|Top with cheddar."],
["Old-Fashioned Chicken & Dumplings","comfort","🥟",65,3,10,6,"Creamy chicken stew with fluffy, tender drop dumplings.","1 1/2 lb|chicken breast;4 tbsp|butter;1|onion;2|carrots;2 stalk|celery;1/3 cup|flour;6 cup|chicken broth;1/2 cup|heavy cream;2 cup|flour|for dumplings;1 tbsp|baking powder;1 cup|milk;|parsley","Cook veggies in butter, stir in flour, then broth. Add chicken and simmer 20 minutes, then shred.|Stir in cream.|Mix 2 cups flour, baking powder, salt, milk and 2 tbsp melted butter. Drop spoonfuls on top.|Cover and simmer 15 minutes without peeking."],
["Mushroom Parmesan Risotto","comfort","🍄",45,3,9.5,4,"Slow-stirred, creamy risotto with golden mushrooms and lots of parmesan.","1 lb|mushrooms;4 tbsp|butter;1|onion|finely diced;2 clove|garlic;1 1/2 cup|arborio rice;6 cup|chicken broth|warm;3/4 cup|parmesan;|parsley","Brown mushrooms in half the butter and set aside.|Cook onion and garlic, then toast the rice 2 minutes.|Add warm broth a ladle at a time, stirring, until creamy and tender, about 20 minutes.|Stir in mushrooms, remaining butter and parmesan."],
["Baked Eggplant Parmesan","comfort","🍆",60,3,9,6,"Crispy breaded eggplant layered with marinara and melty cheese.","2|eggplant|sliced;1 cup|flour;3|eggs;2 cup|breadcrumbs;1 cup|parmesan;1 jar|marinara sauce;2 cup|mozzarella;3 tbsp|olive oil;|basil","Salt eggplant 15 minutes and pat dry.|Dredge in flour, egg, then breadcrumbs with half the parmesan, and bake on oiled pans at 425°F 20 minutes, flipping once.|Layer with marinara, mozzarella and parmesan.|Bake at 375°F for 25 minutes and top with basil."],
["Ricotta Spinach Stuffed Shells","comfort","🐚",55,3,9.5,6,"Jumbo shells filled with herby ricotta and spinach, baked in marinara.","12 oz|jumbo pasta shells;15 oz|ricotta;2 cup|mozzarella;1/2 cup|parmesan;1|eggs;10 oz|frozen spinach|thawed, squeezed;2 clove|garlic;1 jar|marinara sauce","Boil shells until just tender.|Mix ricotta, 1 cup mozzarella, parmesan, egg, spinach and garlic.|Spread sauce in a dish, fill shells and nestle them in, then top with sauce and mozzarella.|Bake covered at 375°F 25 minutes, then uncovered 10."],
["BBQ Pulled Pork Sandwiches","comfort","🐷",420,1,9,8,"Slow-cooker pulled pork with tangy slaw. Set it in the morning, feast at night.","3 lb|pork shoulder;2 tbsp|brown sugar;1 tbsp|paprika;1 tsp|garlic powder;1 tsp|onion powder;1 1/2 cup|bbq sauce;1/2 cup|chicken broth;8|burger buns;3 cup|coleslaw mix;1/3 cup|mayonnaise;1 tbsp|apple cider vinegar","Rub pork with sugar and spices.|Slow cook with broth low 8 hours or high 5 hours.|Shred, drain and toss with BBQ sauce.|Mix slaw with mayo and vinegar and pile it all on buns."],
["One-Pot Chili Mac","comfort","🌶️",35,2,9.5,6,"Chili and mac and cheese had a baby. Everyone wins.","1 lb|ground beef;1|onion;2 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|chili powder;1 tsp|cumin;1 can|diced tomatoes;1 can|kidney beans;3 cup|beef broth;2 cup|elbow macaroni;1 1/2 cup|cheddar","Brown beef with onion, garlic and spices.|Add tomatoes, beans and broth and bring to a boil.|Add macaroni and simmer covered 12 minutes, stirring.|Stir in cheddar until melty."],
["Slow Cooker Beef Pot Roast","comfort","🥩",480,1,10,6,"Fork-tender roast with carrots and potatoes in savory gravy.","3 lb|chuck roast;2 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;4|carrots;2 lb|potatoes;4 clove|garlic;2 cup|beef broth;2 tbsp|tomato paste;1 tbsp|worcestershire;1 tsp|dried thyme;2 tbsp|cornstarch","Season and sear the roast on all sides.|Put veggies in the slow cooker, roast on top, then broth, tomato paste, worcestershire and thyme.|Cook low 8 hours.|Thicken the juices with cornstarch slurry for gravy."],
["Creamy Polenta with Mushrooms","comfort","🍄",35,2,9,4,"Buttery, cheesy polenta topped with garlicky mushrooms.","1 cup|polenta;4 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|milk;3 tbsp|butter;1/2 cup|parmesan;1 lb|mushrooms;3 clove|garlic;1 tsp|dried thyme","Simmer broth and milk, whisk in polenta and cook 20 to 25 minutes, stirring often.|Stir in 1 tbsp butter and parmesan.|Brown mushrooms in remaining butter with garlic and thyme.|Spoon over polenta."],
["Chicken Tikka Masala","comfort","🍛",50,3,9,4,"Charred spiced chicken in a creamy, fragrant tomato sauce. Grab the naan.","1 1/2 lb|chicken thighs;1/2 cup|greek yogurt;2 tbsp|garam masala;1 tsp|cumin;1 tsp|paprika;4 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;3 tbsp|butter;1|onion;1 can|crushed tomatoes|15 oz;3/4 cup|heavy cream;1 1/2 cup|rice;4|naan;|cilantro","Marinate chicken in yogurt, half the garam masala, cumin, paprika and half the garlic.|Broil 8 to 10 minutes until charred and cut into bites.|Cook onion in butter, add garlic, ginger and garam masala, then tomatoes for 10 minutes.|Stir in cream and chicken. Serve with rice, naan and cilantro."],
["Tender Cabbage Rolls","comfort","🥬",90,3,10,6,"Old-world comfort: beef and rice wrapped in cabbage, baked in tomato sauce.","1|cabbage;1 lb|ground beef;3/4 cup|rice|cooked;1|onion;2 clove|garlic;1|eggs;1 tsp|paprika;1 can|tomato sauce;1 can|diced tomatoes;1 tbsp|brown sugar","Core the cabbage and simmer it whole until leaves peel off easily.|Mix beef, rice, onion, garlic, egg and paprika.|Roll filling in leaves and place in a dish.|Cover with sauce mixed with sugar and bake covered at 350°F for 1 hour."],
["Creamy Spinach Parmesan Orzo","comfort","🧀",25,1,9,4,"Risotto-like creamy orzo, but faster and with way less stirring.","2 tbsp|butter;2 clove|garlic;1 1/2 cup|orzo;3 cup|chicken broth;1/2 cup|heavy cream;3/4 cup|parmesan;3 cup|spinach;1/2|lemon","Melt butter with garlic and toast the orzo 2 minutes.|Add broth and simmer 10 minutes, stirring often.|Stir in cream, parmesan, spinach and lemon."],
// ================= PART 4 =================
["Mediterranean Chickpea Salad","lunch","🥗",15,1,6.5,4,"Crunchy, lemony and packed with protein. Meal prep friendly.","2 can|chickpeas;1|cucumber;1 pint|cherry tomatoes;1/2|red onion;1/2 cup|olives;1/2 cup|feta;3 tbsp|olive oil;1|lemon;1 tsp|oregano;|parsley","Chop the veggies.|Whisk oil, lemon juice, oregano, salt and pepper.|Toss everything and top with feta."],
["Greek Chicken Pita Pockets","lunch","🥙",25,2,7.5,4,"Lemony oregano chicken with cool tzatziki stuffed in warm pitas.","1 lb|chicken breast;2 tbsp|olive oil;1|lemon;1 tsp|oregano;2 clove|garlic;4|pita;1 cup|greek yogurt;1|cucumber;1|tomatoes;1/2|red onion","Marinate chicken in oil, lemon, oregano and garlic for 10 minutes and cook 5 to 6 minutes per side.|Grate half the cucumber into yogurt with salt for tzatziki.|Slice chicken and stuff pitas with veggies and sauce."],
["Turkey Avocado Club","lunch","🥪",15,1,7.5,2,"Triple-decker turkey, bacon and avocado. A deli classic.","6 slice|bread;8 oz|deli turkey;4 slice|bacon|cooked;1|avocado;1|tomatoes;2 leaf|lettuce;2 tbsp|mayonnaise","Toast the bread and spread with mayo.|Layer turkey, bacon, avocado, tomato and lettuce over two levels.|Secure with picks and cut into triangles."],
["Caprese Panini","lunch","🥪",15,1,8,2,"Fresh mozzarella, tomato and basil pressed until gooey.","4 slice|bread;8 oz|fresh mozzarella;1|tomatoes;|basil;2 tbsp|pesto;1 tbsp|olive oil;|balsamic glaze","Spread pesto on the bread.|Layer mozzarella, tomato and basil.|Brush the outside with oil and press in a hot pan 3 minutes per side. Drizzle with balsamic."],
["Lemon Dill Tuna Pasta Salad","lunch","🍝",20,1,7.5,4,"Cool, creamy, lemony pasta salad. Picnic-ready.","8 oz|rotini;2 can|tuna;1/2 cup|mayonnaise;1|lemon;2 tbsp|dill;2 stalk|celery;1/2|red onion;1 cup|frozen peas","Cook pasta, adding peas in the last minute. Rinse cold.|Mix mayo, lemon juice and zest, dill, salt and pepper.|Toss with tuna, celery, onion and pasta."],
["Sesame Soba Noodle Salad","lunch","🍜",20,2,7,4,"Chilled noodles and crunchy veggies in a nutty sesame dressing.","8 oz|soba noodles;3 tbsp|soy sauce;2 tbsp|sesame oil;1 tbsp|rice vinegar;1 tbsp|honey;1 tsp|ginger;1|cucumber;2|carrots;1 cup|edamame;2|green onion;1 tbsp|sesame seeds","Cook soba and rinse cold.|Whisk soy, sesame oil, vinegar, honey and ginger.|Toss with julienned veggies and edamame and top with sesame seeds."],
["Quinoa Black Bean Bowls","lunch","🥣",25,2,7.5,4,"Hearty, colorful and vegetarian. Corn, beans, avocado and lime.","1 cup|quinoa;1 can|black beans;1 cup|frozen corn;1 pint|cherry tomatoes;1|avocado;1|lime;1 tsp|cumin;2 tbsp|olive oil;|cilantro;1/2 cup|salsa","Cook quinoa.|Warm beans and corn with cumin.|Build bowls with quinoa, beans, corn, tomatoes, avocado, salsa and cilantro.|Dress with lime and oil."],
["Avocado Egg Salad Toast","lunch","🥑",15,1,7.5,2,"Creamy egg salad made with avocado on crispy toast.","4|eggs;1|avocado;1 tbsp|mayonnaise;1 tsp|dijon mustard;1/2|lemon;4 slice|bread;|everything bagel seasoning","Hard boil eggs 10 minutes, chill and chop.|Mash avocado with mayo, dijon and lemon and fold in eggs.|Pile on toast and sprinkle with seasoning."],
["Hummus Roasted Vegetable Wraps","lunch","🌯",30,2,7.5,4,"Smoky roasted veggies, creamy hummus and feta rolled up.","1|zucchini;1|bell pepper;1|red onion;1|eggplant;3 tbsp|olive oil;1 tsp|paprika;4|flour tortillas;1 cup|hummus;1/2 cup|feta;2 cup|spinach","Roast chopped veggies with oil and paprika at 425°F for 20 minutes.|Spread hummus on tortillas.|Add spinach, veggies and feta and roll up."],
["Shrimp Avocado Rice Bowls","lunch","🍤",25,2,7.5,4,"Garlicky shrimp over rice with avocado and a creamy sriracha drizzle.","1 lb|shrimp;2 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|olive oil;1 tsp|paprika;1 1/2 cup|rice;1|avocado;1|cucumber;1 cup|frozen corn;2 tbsp|mayonnaise;1 tbsp|sriracha;1|lime","Cook rice.|Sauté shrimp with garlic, paprika and oil 2 minutes per side.|Mix mayo and sriracha.|Build bowls and squeeze lime on top."],
["Crispy Tofu Lettuce Wraps","light","🥬",25,2,7,4,"Golden crispy tofu tossed in sweet chili soy sauce, wrapped in lettuce.","14 oz|tofu|extra firm, pressed;2 tbsp|cornstarch;2 tbsp|vegetable oil;3 tbsp|soy sauce;2 tbsp|sweet chili sauce;1 tsp|ginger;1 head|butter lettuce;2|carrots|shredded;2|green onion","Cube tofu, toss with cornstarch and pan fry until crispy on all sides.|Toss with soy, sweet chili and ginger.|Spoon into lettuce cups with carrots and green onion."],
["Roasted Sweet Potatoes with Buffalo Chicken","light","🍠",45,2,8,4,"Crispy sweet potatoes topped with buffalo chicken and ranch.","2 lb|sweet potatoes;2 tbsp|olive oil;1 lb|chicken breast|cooked, shredded;1/3 cup|buffalo sauce;1/4 cup|ranch dressing;2|green onion","Halve or cube sweet potatoes, toss with oil and roast at 425°F for 30 to 35 minutes.|Toss chicken with buffalo sauce.|Top potatoes with chicken, ranch and green onion."],
["Salmon Niçoise Salad","light","🥗",30,3,7,4,"French bistro salad with salmon, jammy eggs, potatoes and green beans.","4 fillet|salmon;1 lb|baby potatoes;8 oz|green beans;4|eggs;1 head|butter lettuce;1/2 cup|olives;1 pint|cherry tomatoes;3 tbsp|olive oil;1 tbsp|dijon mustard;1|lemon","Boil potatoes 12 minutes, adding green beans for the last 3. Boil eggs 7 minutes.|Roast salmon at 400°F for 12 minutes.|Whisk oil, dijon and lemon.|Arrange everything on lettuce and drizzle."],
["Greek Orzo Salad","light","🥗",20,1,7,6,"Lemony orzo with cucumber, tomatoes, olives and feta.","1 1/2 cup|orzo;1|cucumber;1 pint|cherry tomatoes;1/2|red onion;1/2 cup|olives;3/4 cup|feta;1/4 cup|olive oil;1|lemon;1 tsp|oregano","Cook orzo and rinse cool.|Chop veggies.|Whisk oil, lemon and oregano and toss everything with feta."],
["Turkey Meatball Pitas","light","🥙",35,2,8,4,"Juicy herby turkey meatballs with tzatziki and crunchy veggies.","1 lb|ground turkey;1/3 cup|breadcrumbs;1|eggs;2 clove|garlic;1 tsp|oregano;4|pita;1 cup|greek yogurt;1|cucumber;1|tomatoes;1/2|red onion","Mix turkey, breadcrumbs, egg, garlic and oregano and roll into meatballs.|Bake at 400°F for 15 to 18 minutes.|Mix yogurt with grated cucumber and salt.|Stuff pitas with meatballs, veggies and sauce."],
["Zucchini Fritters with Yogurt","light","🥒",25,2,7.5,4,"Crispy golden zucchini fritters with a cool garlicky yogurt dip.","2|zucchini|grated;1|eggs;1/2 cup|flour;1/2 cup|parmesan;2|green onion;1 clove|garlic;3 tbsp|olive oil;1/2 cup|greek yogurt;1/2|lemon","Salt grated zucchini 10 minutes and squeeze dry.|Mix with egg, flour, parmesan, green onion and garlic.|Pan fry spoonfuls in oil 3 minutes per side.|Mix yogurt with lemon and salt for dipping."],
["Lemon Garlic Cod & Asparagus","light","🐟",25,1,7,4,"Light, flaky and buttery. Sheet pan dinner in 25.","4 fillet|cod;1 lb|asparagus;4 tbsp|butter|melted;3 clove|garlic;1|lemon;1/2 tsp|paprika;|parsley","Arrange cod and asparagus on a sheet pan.|Mix butter, garlic, lemon juice, paprika, salt and pepper and pour over.|Bake at 400°F for 12 to 15 minutes and top with parsley."],
["Vegetable & Feta Frittata","light","🍳",25,2,7.5,4,"Fluffy oven frittata full of veggies and salty feta.","8|eggs;1/4 cup|milk;1 tbsp|olive oil;1|bell pepper;1/2|onion;2 cup|spinach;1 cup|cherry tomatoes;1/2 cup|feta","Whisk eggs, milk, salt and pepper.|Sauté pepper and onion in an oven-safe skillet, add spinach and tomatoes.|Pour in eggs, add feta and cook 3 minutes.|Bake at 375°F for 12 to 15 minutes."],
["Pesto Mozzarella Flatbreads","light","🫓",20,1,8,4,"Crispy flatbreads with pesto, melty mozzarella and cherry tomatoes.","4|naan;1/2 cup|pesto;2 cup|mozzarella;1 cup|cherry tomatoes;|basil;|balsamic glaze","Spread pesto on naan.|Top with mozzarella and halved tomatoes.|Bake at 425°F for 8 to 10 minutes and finish with basil and balsamic."],
["Teriyaki Tofu Rice Bowls","light","🍱",25,2,7.5,4,"Crispy tofu in sticky homemade teriyaki over rice with broccoli.","14 oz|tofu|extra firm;2 tbsp|cornstarch;2 tbsp|vegetable oil;1/3 cup|soy sauce;3 tbsp|honey;1 tbsp|rice vinegar;2 clove|garlic;1 tsp|ginger;1 1/2 cup|rice;1 head|broccoli;1 tsp|sesame seeds","Cook rice and steam broccoli.|Toss cubed tofu in cornstarch and fry until crispy.|Simmer soy, honey, vinegar, garlic and ginger and toss with tofu.|Build bowls and top with sesame seeds."],
["Chicken Couscous Salad","light","🥗",25,2,7.5,4,"Fluffy couscous, chicken, herbs and veggies in a lemon dressing.","1 cup|couscous;1 lb|chicken breast;3 tbsp|olive oil;1|lemon;1|cucumber;1 pint|cherry tomatoes;1/2 cup|feta;|parsley;1 tsp|cumin","Pour 1 1/4 cups boiling water over couscous, cover 5 minutes and fluff.|Season chicken with cumin and cook 5 to 6 minutes per side.|Toss couscous with chopped veggies, oil and lemon.|Top with sliced chicken and feta."],
["Smashed Chickpea Sandwich","light","🥪",15,1,7.5,2,"Like chicken salad but with chickpeas. Creamy, crunchy, quick.","1 can|chickpeas;3 tbsp|mayonnaise;1 tsp|dijon mustard;1 stalk|celery;1/2|lemon;4 slice|bread;2 leaf|lettuce","Mash chickpeas roughly with a fork.|Mix in mayo, dijon, celery, lemon, salt and pepper.|Pile on bread with lettuce."],
["Mediterranean Baked Sweet Potatoes","light","🍠",45,2,8,4,"Fluffy baked sweet potatoes stuffed with spiced chickpeas and feta.","4|sweet potatoes;1 can|chickpeas;1 tbsp|olive oil;1 tsp|cumin;1 tsp|paprika;1/2 cup|greek yogurt;1/2|lemon;1/2 cup|feta;|parsley","Bake sweet potatoes at 425°F for 40 to 45 minutes.|Roast chickpeas with oil and spices for the last 20 minutes.|Split potatoes and stuff with chickpeas, lemony yogurt, feta and parsley."],
["Crispy Fish & Cabbage Slaw Bowls","light","🐟",25,2,7.5,4,"Panko-crusted fish over rice with a tangy cabbage slaw.","1 lb|cod;1|eggs;1 cup|panko;1 tsp|paprika;2 tbsp|vegetable oil;1 1/2 cup|rice;3 cup|coleslaw mix;3 tbsp|mayonnaise;1|lime;|cilantro","Cook rice. Dip fish in egg, then panko with paprika.|Pan fry 3 to 4 minutes per side.|Toss slaw with mayo, lime and salt.|Build bowls with rice, slaw, fish and cilantro."],
// ================= PART 5 =================
["Sheet-Pan Lemon Herb Chicken","quick","🍋",40,1,8.5,4,"Juicy roasted thighs and crispy potatoes on one pan. Almost no dishes.","2 lb|chicken thighs;1 1/2 lb|potatoes;2|lemon;4 clove|garlic;3 tbsp|olive oil;2 tsp|italian seasoning;1 tsp|paprika;|parsley","Roast oiled, seasoned potatoes at 425°F for 10 minutes.|Toss chicken with oil, lemon juice, garlic, seasoning and paprika.|Add to the pan with lemon slices and roast 25 to 30 minutes.|Top with parsley."],
["One-Pot Taco Rice","quick","🌮",30,2,8.5,4,"Taco night in a single pot: beef, rice, beans and cheese.","1 lb|ground beef;1|onion;2 tbsp|taco seasoning;1 cup|rice;1 can|black beans;1 can|diced tomatoes;2 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|mexican cheese blend;|sour cream;|cilantro","Brown beef with onion and taco seasoning.|Add rice, beans, tomatoes and broth, cover and simmer 18 to 20 minutes.|Top with cheese, cover until melted and serve with sour cream."],
["Honey Soy Pork Chops","quick","🥩",25,2,8.5,4,"Caramelized honey soy glaze on juicy chops.","4|pork chops;1 tbsp|olive oil;3 tbsp|honey;3 tbsp|soy sauce;3 clove|garlic;1 tsp|ginger;1 tbsp|butter;1 lb|green beans","Season chops and sear 4 to 5 minutes per side to 145°F.|Add honey, soy, garlic and ginger and spoon the glaze over.|Cook green beans in the pan with butter and a splash of water."],
["Garlic Butter Shrimp Linguine","quick","🍤",25,2,8.5,4,"Garlicky lemon butter shrimp over linguine. Fancy in 25.","12 oz|linguine;1 lb|shrimp;4 tbsp|butter;5 clove|garlic;1/4 tsp|red pepper flakes;1/2 cup|chicken broth;1|lemon;1/4 cup|parmesan;|parsley","Cook linguine.|Sear shrimp in 1 tbsp butter and set aside.|Melt remaining butter with garlic and pepper flakes, add broth and lemon and simmer 2 minutes.|Toss pasta and shrimp with parmesan and parsley."],
["Teriyaki Beef Noodle Stir-Fry","quick","🍜",25,2,8,4,"Saucy beef and veggies tossed with chewy noodles.","1 lb|flank steak|thin slices;8 oz|lo mein noodles;1/3 cup|soy sauce;3 tbsp|honey;1 tbsp|rice vinegar;2 clove|garlic;1 tsp|ginger;1 tbsp|cornstarch;2 tbsp|vegetable oil;1|bell pepper;1 head|broccoli","Cook noodles.|Whisk soy, honey, vinegar, garlic, ginger, cornstarch and 1/4 cup water.|Sear beef in oil and set aside. Stir-fry veggies 3 minutes.|Add noodles, beef and sauce and toss until glossy."],
["20-Minute Turkey Bolognese","quick","🍝",25,2,8.5,4,"A lighter, faster bolognese that still tastes like Sunday sauce.","1 lb|ground turkey;1 tbsp|olive oil;1|onion;1|carrots|grated;3 clove|garlic;2 tbsp|tomato paste;1 can|crushed tomatoes;1 tsp|italian seasoning;1/4 cup|heavy cream;12 oz|spaghetti;|parmesan","Brown turkey in oil with onion and carrot.|Add garlic and tomato paste, then tomatoes and seasoning, and simmer 12 minutes.|Stir in cream.|Toss with spaghetti and parmesan."],
["Creamy Cajun Shrimp Pasta","quick","🌶️",30,2,8.5,4,"Spicy cajun shrimp in a creamy parmesan sauce.","12 oz|penne;1 lb|shrimp;1 1/2 tbsp|cajun seasoning;2 tbsp|butter;3 clove|garlic;1|bell pepper;1 1/2 cup|heavy cream;3/4 cup|parmesan;|parsley","Cook pasta. Toss shrimp with half the cajun and sear in butter, then set aside.|Cook pepper and garlic, add cream and remaining cajun.|Stir in parmesan, pasta and shrimp."],
["Chickpea Coconut Curry","quick","🥥",25,1,8.5,4,"Creamy, cozy vegetarian curry with chickpeas and spinach.","1 tbsp|vegetable oil;1|onion;3 clove|garlic;1 tbsp|ginger;2 tbsp|curry powder;2 can|chickpeas;1 can|coconut milk;1 can|diced tomatoes;3 cup|spinach;1|lime;1 1/2 cup|rice","Cook rice.|Cook onion, garlic and ginger in oil, then curry powder for 1 minute.|Add chickpeas, coconut milk and tomatoes and simmer 12 minutes.|Stir in spinach and lime."],
["Korean Beef Rice Bowls","quick","🍚",20,1,8,4,"Sweet, savory ground beef bulgogi-style over rice. Weeknight hero.","1 lb|ground beef;3 clove|garlic;1 tsp|ginger;1/4 cup|soy sauce;3 tbsp|brown sugar;1 tsp|sesame oil;1/2 tsp|red pepper flakes;1 1/2 cup|rice;1|cucumber;2|green onion;1 tsp|sesame seeds","Cook rice.|Brown beef with garlic and ginger.|Add soy, brown sugar, sesame oil and pepper flakes and simmer 2 minutes.|Serve over rice with cucumber, green onion and sesame.","hot"],
["Crispy Fish Tacos","quick","🌮",25,2,7.5,4,"Crunchy panko fish, tangy slaw and lime crema.","1 lb|cod;1|eggs;1 cup|panko;1 tsp|chili powder;2 tbsp|vegetable oil;8|corn tortillas;2 cup|coleslaw mix;1/2 cup|sour cream;2|lime;1|avocado","Dip fish strips in egg, then panko with chili powder, and pan fry until golden.|Mix sour cream with lime and salt.|Fill tortillas with slaw, fish, avocado and crema."],
["Sheet-Pan Sausage & Vegetables","quick","🫑",35,1,8,4,"Smoky sausage and colorful roasted veggies, one pan.","14 oz|smoked sausage;1 lb|baby potatoes;1|bell pepper;1|zucchini;1 head|broccoli;3 tbsp|olive oil;1 tsp|italian seasoning;1 tsp|paprika","Toss potatoes with oil and roast at 425°F for 10 minutes.|Add sliced sausage and remaining veggies with oil and spices.|Roast 20 more minutes."],
["Maple Dijon Salmon","quick","🐟",25,1,8,4,"Sweet-tangy maple mustard glaze on tender salmon.","4 fillet|salmon;3 tbsp|maple syrup;2 tbsp|dijon mustard;1 tbsp|soy sauce;2 clove|garlic;1 lb|asparagus;1 tbsp|olive oil","Whisk maple, dijon, soy and garlic.|Arrange salmon and oiled asparagus on a sheet pan and brush salmon with glaze.|Bake at 400°F for 12 to 14 minutes."],
["One-Pot Lemon Parmesan Pasta","quick","🍋",20,1,8.5,4,"Pasta cooked right in its silky lemon parmesan sauce.","12 oz|spaghetti;3 cup|chicken broth;1 cup|milk;2 tbsp|butter;2 clove|garlic;1|lemon;3/4 cup|parmesan;|black pepper","Add pasta, broth, milk, butter and garlic to a wide pot and bring to a boil.|Simmer, stirring often, 10 to 12 minutes until the liquid is mostly absorbed.|Stir in lemon zest, juice, parmesan and lots of pepper."],
["Spicy Peanut Noodles","quick","🥜",15,1,8,4,"Silky, spicy peanut sauce on noodles. Pantry dinner gold.","8 oz|spaghetti;1/3 cup|peanut butter;3 tbsp|soy sauce;1 tbsp|honey;1 tbsp|rice vinegar;1 tbsp|sriracha;1 tsp|sesame oil;2 clove|garlic;2|green onion;1|cucumber","Cook noodles, saving some water.|Whisk peanut butter, soy, honey, vinegar, sriracha, sesame oil and garlic with hot pasta water until smooth.|Toss noodles in sauce and top with cucumber and green onion."],
["Pesto Chicken Flatbread","quick","🫓",20,1,8,4,"Pesto, chicken and melty mozzarella on crispy naan.","4|naan;1/3 cup|pesto;1/2 lb|chicken breast|cooked;1 1/2 cup|mozzarella;1 cup|cherry tomatoes;1 cup|spinach","Spread pesto on naan.|Top with chicken, mozzarella and tomatoes.|Bake at 425°F for 10 minutes and add spinach."],
["Turkey Taco Skillet","quick","🌮",25,2,8.5,4,"Taco-spiced turkey, peppers and beans under melted cheese.","1 lb|ground turkey;1|bell pepper;1|onion;2 tbsp|taco seasoning;1 can|black beans;1 cup|frozen corn;1/2 cup|salsa;1 cup|mexican cheese blend;|tortilla chips","Brown turkey with pepper and onion.|Add taco seasoning, beans, corn and salsa and simmer 5 minutes.|Top with cheese, cover until melted and scoop with chips."],
["Air Fryer Chicken Tenders","quick","🍗",25,2,8.5,4,"Extra crunchy tenders with honey mustard, no deep fryer needed.","1 1/2 lb|chicken breast|strips;1/2 cup|flour;2|eggs;1 1/2 cup|panko;1 tsp|paprika;1 tsp|garlic powder;2 tbsp|honey;2 tbsp|dijon mustard;2 tbsp|mayonnaise","Season the flour with paprika, garlic powder and salt.|Dredge chicken in flour, egg, then panko.|Spray and air fry at 400°F for 10 to 12 minutes, flipping halfway.|Mix honey, dijon and mayo for dipping."],
["Sesame Ginger Tofu Stir-Fry","quick","🥦",25,2,7.5,4,"Crispy tofu and crunchy veggies in a sesame ginger sauce.","14 oz|tofu|extra firm;2 tbsp|cornstarch;2 tbsp|vegetable oil;1 head|broccoli;1|bell pepper;3 tbsp|soy sauce;1 tbsp|honey;1 tbsp|ginger;1 tsp|sesame oil;1 1/2 cup|rice;1 tsp|sesame seeds","Cook rice. Toss tofu cubes in cornstarch and fry until crispy.|Stir-fry broccoli and pepper 4 minutes.|Add soy, honey, ginger and sesame oil and toss with tofu.|Serve over rice."],
["Cheesy Bean & Rice Burritos","quick","🌯",20,1,8.5,4,"Comforting, cheap and freezer friendly.","4|flour tortillas;1 can|refried beans;1 1/2 cup|rice|cooked;1 1/2 cup|mexican cheese blend;1/2 cup|salsa;1 tsp|cumin","Warm beans with cumin.|Fill tortillas with beans, rice, cheese and salsa.|Roll and toast seam-side down until golden."],
["Garlic Butter Mushroom Chicken","quick","🍄",30,2,9,4,"Golden chicken and mushrooms in a creamy garlic butter sauce.","1 1/2 lb|chicken breast|cutlets;3 tbsp|butter;8 oz|mushrooms;4 clove|garlic;1/2 cup|chicken broth;1/2 cup|heavy cream;1 tsp|dried thyme;|parsley","Sear seasoned chicken in butter 5 minutes per side and set aside.|Brown mushrooms, add garlic and thyme.|Add broth and cream and simmer 3 minutes.|Return chicken and top with parsley."],
["One-Pot Tomato Basil Gnocchi","quick","🍅",20,1,9,4,"Pillowy gnocchi in a creamy tomato basil sauce. One pot, 20 minutes.","1 lb|gnocchi;1 tbsp|olive oil;2 clove|garlic;1 can|crushed tomatoes;1/2 cup|heavy cream;1/2 cup|parmesan;1 cup|mozzarella;|basil","Cook garlic in oil, add tomatoes and simmer 5 minutes.|Add gnocchi and cook 4 minutes until they float.|Stir in cream and parmesan, top with mozzarella and cover until melted. Finish with basil."],
["Crispy Halloumi Grain Bowls","quick","🧀",25,2,7.5,4,"Squeaky golden halloumi over grains with crunchy veggies and lemon.","8 oz|halloumi;1 cup|quinoa;1|cucumber;1 pint|cherry tomatoes;1 can|chickpeas;1/2 cup|hummus;2 tbsp|olive oil;1|lemon","Cook quinoa.|Slice halloumi and pan fry until golden on both sides.|Build bowls with quinoa, chickpeas, veggies and hummus.|Top with halloumi, oil and lemon."],
["Lemon Pepper Turkey Burgers","quick","🍔",25,2,8,4,"Juicy, zesty turkey burgers with a quick lemon mayo.","1 lb|ground turkey;1|lemon;1 tsp|black pepper;2 clove|garlic;1/4 cup|breadcrumbs;4|burger buns;4 slice|provolone;3 tbsp|mayonnaise;2 leaf|lettuce;1|tomatoes","Mix turkey, lemon zest, pepper, garlic and breadcrumbs and form 4 patties.|Cook 5 to 6 minutes per side to 165°F and add cheese.|Mix mayo with lemon juice.|Build burgers with lettuce and tomato."],
["Broccoli Cheddar Baked Potatoes","quick","🥔",50,1,9,4,"Fluffy baked potatoes smothered in a quick broccoli cheese sauce.","4|russet potatoes;1 head|broccoli;2 tbsp|butter;2 tbsp|flour;1 1/2 cup|milk;1 1/2 cup|cheddar;|sour cream","Bake potatoes at 425°F for 45 to 50 minutes (or microwave 8 to 10).|Steam chopped broccoli.|Make a roux with butter and flour, whisk in milk until thick and stir in cheddar and broccoli.|Split potatoes and pour it on."],
// ================= PART 6 =================
["Freezer Breakfast Burritos","breakfast","🌯",35,2,8.5,6,"Bacon, eggs, hash browns and cheese wrapped tight. Make a batch and freeze.","10|eggs;8 slice|bacon;2 cup|frozen hash browns;1 1/2 cup|mexican cheese blend;6|flour tortillas;1 tbsp|butter;|salsa","Cook bacon and chop. Crisp hash browns.|Scramble eggs in butter until just set.|Fill tortillas, roll tight and toast seam-side down.|Cool, wrap in foil and freeze. Reheat 2 minutes in the microwave."],
["Spinach Feta Egg Muffins","breakfast","🧁",25,1,7.5,12,"Grab-and-go egg bites packed with spinach and feta.","10|eggs;1/4 cup|milk;2 cup|spinach;1/2 cup|feta;1/2 cup|cherry tomatoes;|salt|to taste","Grease a 12-cup muffin tin.|Whisk eggs, milk, salt and pepper.|Divide spinach, tomatoes and feta into the cups and pour eggs over.|Bake at 350°F for 18 to 20 minutes."],
["Banana Oat Pancakes","breakfast","🥞",20,1,8,2,"Blender pancakes made with oats and banana. Fluffy and naturally sweet.","1 cup|oats;1|banana;2|eggs;1/2 cup|milk;1 tsp|baking powder;1/2 tsp|cinnamon;1 tbsp|butter;|maple syrup","Blend everything except butter and syrup until smooth and rest 5 minutes.|Cook 1/4 cup portions in butter over medium 2 minutes per side.|Serve with syrup and banana slices."],
["Cinnamon French Toast","breakfast","🍞",20,1,9,3,"Custardy in the middle, caramelized outside, cinnamon-sugar everywhere.","6 slice|bread|thick;3|eggs;3/4 cup|milk;1 tsp|cinnamon;1 tsp|vanilla;1 tbsp|sugar;2 tbsp|butter;|maple syrup;1 cup|strawberries","Whisk eggs, milk, cinnamon, vanilla and sugar.|Dip bread 5 seconds per side.|Cook in butter 2 to 3 minutes per side.|Top with strawberries and syrup."],
["Savory Breakfast Hash","breakfast","🍳",30,2,9,4,"Crispy potatoes, sausage and peppers topped with runny eggs.","1 1/2 lb|potatoes|small dice;1/2 lb|breakfast sausage;1|bell pepper;1/2|onion;2 tbsp|olive oil;1 tsp|paprika;4|eggs;|green onion","Microwave potatoes 5 minutes, then crisp in oil with paprika 10 minutes.|Brown sausage with pepper and onion and combine.|Make 4 wells, crack in eggs, cover and cook until whites set.|Top with green onion."],
["Overnight Apple Cinnamon Oats","breakfast","🍎",10,1,8,2,"Five minutes tonight, apple pie-ish breakfast tomorrow.","1 cup|oats;1 cup|milk;1/2 cup|greek yogurt;2 tbsp|maple syrup;1 tsp|cinnamon;1|apple|diced","Stir oats, milk, yogurt, maple and cinnamon in a jar.|Refrigerate overnight.|Top with diced apple and more cinnamon."],
["Cottage Cheese Egg Bites","breakfast","🥚",25,1,7.5,12,"Starbucks-style sous-vide egg bites, made in a muffin tin.","8|eggs;1 cup|cottage cheese;1 cup|cheddar;4 slice|bacon|cooked;2|green onion","Blend eggs and cottage cheese until smooth.|Divide bacon, cheese and green onion into a greased muffin tin and pour eggs over.|Bake at 325°F in a water bath (pan of hot water on the rack below) 25 minutes."],
["Blueberry Baked Oatmeal","breakfast","🫐",40,2,9,6,"Warm, cakey oatmeal bursting with blueberries.","2 cup|oats;1 tsp|baking powder;1 tsp|cinnamon;1 3/4 cup|milk;1|eggs;1/3 cup|maple syrup;2 tbsp|butter|melted;1 tsp|vanilla;1 1/2 cup|blueberries","Mix oats, baking powder, cinnamon and salt.|Whisk milk, egg, maple, butter and vanilla and combine.|Fold in blueberries and pour into a greased dish.|Bake at 375°F for 35 minutes."],
["Sausage Egg Breakfast Sandwiches","breakfast","🥪",20,1,8.5,4,"Better than the drive-thru: sausage, egg and cheese on toasted muffins.","4|english muffins;1/2 lb|breakfast sausage;4|eggs;4 slice|american cheese;1 tbsp|butter","Form sausage into 4 thin patties and cook 3 to 4 minutes per side.|Fry eggs in butter.|Toast muffins and stack sausage, egg and cheese."],
["Breakfast Quesadillas","breakfast","🧀",15,1,8,2,"Scrambled eggs and cheese crisped up in a tortilla.","4|eggs;2|flour tortillas;1 cup|mexican cheese blend;1 tbsp|butter;|salsa","Scramble eggs softly.|Fill half of each tortilla with eggs and cheese and fold.|Crisp in butter 2 minutes per side and serve with salsa."],
["Sheet-Pan Pancakes","breakfast","🥞",25,1,8.5,6,"Pancakes for a crowd, all at once. Top half with berries, half with chocolate chips.","2 cup|flour;2 tbsp|sugar;2 tsp|baking powder;1/2 tsp|salt;1 1/2 cup|milk;2|eggs;4 tbsp|butter|melted;1 tsp|vanilla;1 cup|blueberries;1/2 cup|chocolate chips;|maple syrup","Heat oven to 425°F and grease a sheet pan.|Whisk dry and wet ingredients separately, then combine.|Spread on the pan and scatter toppings.|Bake 12 to 15 minutes and cut into squares."],
["Strawberry Yogurt Parfaits","breakfast","🍓",10,1,6.5,2,"Layers of creamy yogurt, crunchy granola and juicy berries.","2 cup|greek yogurt;1 cup|granola;1 1/2 cup|strawberries;2 tbsp|honey","Slice strawberries and toss with a little honey.|Layer yogurt, granola and berries in glasses.|Drizzle with honey."],
["Creamy Rice Pudding","treats","🍚",35,2,9.5,6,"Old-fashioned stovetop rice pudding with cinnamon and vanilla.","3/4 cup|rice;4 cup|milk;1/2 cup|sugar;1 tsp|vanilla;1/2 tsp|cinnamon;|salt|pinch","Simmer rice, milk, sugar and salt, stirring often, 30 to 35 minutes until thick and creamy.|Stir in vanilla.|Serve warm or cold with cinnamon on top."],
["Cinnamon Apple Crisp","treats","🍎",45,2,10,6,"Tender cinnamon apples under a buttery oat crumble. Ice cream required.","6|apple|sliced;2 tbsp|sugar;1 tsp|cinnamon;1 tbsp|lemon juice;3/4 cup|oats;1/2 cup|flour;1/2 cup|brown sugar;6 tbsp|butter|cold;|vanilla ice cream","Toss apples with sugar, cinnamon and lemon in a baking dish.|Rub oats, flour, brown sugar and butter into clumps and scatter over.|Bake at 350°F for 40 to 45 minutes until bubbly and golden."],
["Brown Butter Chocolate Chip Cookies","treats","🍪",30,2,9.5,24,"Chewy middles, crispy edges, nutty brown butter. Dessert is its own stomach.","1 cup|butter;1 cup|brown sugar;1/2 cup|sugar;2|eggs;2 tsp|vanilla;2 1/4 cup|flour;1 tsp|baking soda;1 tsp|salt;2 cup|chocolate chips","Brown the butter until nutty and cool 10 minutes.|Whisk in sugars, eggs and vanilla.|Stir in flour, baking soda, salt and chips. Chill 30 minutes if you can.|Bake at 350°F for 10 to 12 minutes."],
["Cinnamon Roll Mug Cake","treats","☕",10,1,9,1,"A gooey cinnamon roll in a mug, ready in 2 minutes.","4 tbsp|flour;1 tbsp|sugar;1/4 tsp|baking powder;3 tbsp|milk;1 tbsp|vegetable oil;1/4 tsp|vanilla;1 tbsp|brown sugar;1/2 tsp|cinnamon;2 tbsp|powdered sugar","Mix flour, sugar, baking powder, milk, oil and vanilla in a mug.|Swirl in brown sugar and cinnamon.|Microwave 60 to 75 seconds.|Mix powdered sugar with a few drops of milk and drizzle on top."],
["Classic Banana Bread","treats","🍌",70,2,9.5,8,"Moist, tender and perfect with coffee. Brown bananas finally have a purpose.","3|banana|very ripe;1/3 cup|butter|melted;3/4 cup|sugar;1|eggs;1 tsp|vanilla;1 tsp|baking soda;1 1/2 cup|flour;1/2 tsp|cinnamon;|salt|pinch","Mash bananas and stir in butter, sugar, egg and vanilla.|Stir in baking soda, salt, cinnamon and flour until just combined.|Bake in a greased loaf pan at 350°F for 55 to 65 minutes."],
["Warm Baked Cinnamon Apples","treats","🍎",25,1,9,4,"Soft, buttery cinnamon apples. Like pie filling with no crust work.","4|apple|sliced;2 tbsp|butter;2 tbsp|brown sugar;1 tsp|cinnamon;|vanilla ice cream","Toss apples with melted butter, brown sugar and cinnamon.|Bake at 375°F for 20 to 25 minutes (or cook in a skillet 10 minutes).|Serve warm with ice cream."],
["Peanut Butter Energy Bites","treats","🥜",15,1,6.5,16,"No-bake bites for a sweet snack that's kinda healthy.","1 cup|oats;1/2 cup|peanut butter;1/3 cup|honey;1/2 cup|chocolate chips;1 tsp|vanilla","Stir everything together.|Chill 20 minutes.|Roll into balls and keep in the fridge."],
["Warm Berry Crumble","treats","🫐",35,2,9.5,6,"Jammy bubbling berries under a golden buttery crumble.","4 cup|frozen berries;2 tbsp|sugar;1 tbsp|cornstarch;1|lemon;3/4 cup|flour;1/2 cup|oats;1/2 cup|brown sugar;6 tbsp|butter|cold;|vanilla ice cream","Toss berries with sugar, cornstarch and lemon in a baking dish.|Rub flour, oats, brown sugar and butter into crumbs and scatter on top.|Bake at 375°F for 30 to 35 minutes."],
["Homemade Soft Pretzel Bites","treats","🥨",75,3,9,6,"Chewy, salty pretzel bites with a beer-cheese-style dip.","1 1/2 cup|warm water;1 packet|yeast;1 tbsp|sugar;4 cup|flour;4 tbsp|butter;1/2 cup|baking soda;|coarse salt;1 cup|cheddar;1/2 cup|milk","Mix water, yeast and sugar, then add flour, 2 tbsp butter and salt and knead. Rise 45 minutes.|Roll into ropes and cut into bites.|Boil in water with baking soda 30 seconds, top with coarse salt and bake at 450°F for 12 minutes.|Melt cheddar into warm milk for dip and brush bites with remaining butter."],
["Garlic Parmesan Pull-Apart Bread","treats","🧄",30,1,9.5,6,"Buttery garlic biscuit bites baked together, then pulled apart.","1 can|refrigerated biscuits;4 tbsp|butter|melted;3 clove|garlic;1/2 cup|parmesan;1 cup|mozzarella;1 tsp|italian seasoning;|marinara sauce|for dipping","Cut biscuits into quarters.|Toss with butter, garlic, seasoning and cheeses.|Pile into a greased pan and bake at 350°F for 25 minutes.|Pull apart and dip in marinara."],
["Creamy Spinach Artichoke Dip","treats","🥬",35,2,9,8,"Hot, bubbly and cheesy. The appetizer that becomes dinner.","8 oz|cream cheese;1/2 cup|sour cream;1/4 cup|mayonnaise;1 can|artichoke hearts;10 oz|frozen spinach|thawed, squeezed;2 clove|garlic;1 cup|mozzarella;1/2 cup|parmesan;|tortilla chips","Mix cream cheese, sour cream, mayo and garlic.|Stir in chopped artichokes, spinach and most of the cheese.|Top with remaining cheese and bake at 375°F for 25 minutes.|Serve with chips."],
["Cheesy Garlic Bread Pizza","treats","🍕",20,1,9,4,"French bread pizza with garlic butter. Snack-time legend.","1|french bread;4 tbsp|butter;3 clove|garlic;1/2 cup|marinara sauce;2 cup|mozzarella;2 oz|pepperoni;1 tsp|italian seasoning","Split the bread lengthwise and brush with garlic butter.|Spread with marinara and top with mozzarella, pepperoni and seasoning.|Bake at 425°F for 10 to 12 minutes."]
];
